Ray: ac_preconnect, the command bar's preconnect (Chrome's omnibox does the same for its default match through
LoadingPredictor::PrepareForPageLoad with HintOrigin::OMNIBOX), so a site's first visit has DNS, connect and TLS
done before Enter. Gated, as Chrome's is, on network prediction (prefetch::IsSomePreloadingEnabled).


